# Test spec rules

- Import `test` and `expect` from `@playwright/test` or from `framework/fixtures/base.fixture` when using fixtures.
- Keep specs **thin**: scenario flow and assertions only.
- Use credentials from `framework/data/users.ts` — never hardcode passwords in specs.
- Prefer Page Objects and components over inline `page.locator()` when available.
- Use `getByTestId()` with keys from `framework/constants/selectors.ts` for new locators.
- One clear test name describing user-visible outcome.
- Do not remove or disable existing tests without explicit approval.
- Avoid `test.only` in committed code (CI uses `forbidOnly`).
